2	 * BBR-truth resolver: the authoritative source of truth for the eval harness.
3	 *
4	 * Reads eval/bbr-truth.json (values scraped live from basketball-reference.com,
5	 * NBA-only, stamped with an asOf date) and resolves a groundTruthId to the BBR
6	 * value. This is the anchor of the three-way comparison: agent vs DB vs BBR.
7	 *
8	 * Per project rule: nothing in the legacy ground-truth.json is trusted. Only
9	 * entries marked verified:true here count as fact. For unverified ids,
10	 * `verified` comes back false and the harness must NOT classify a DB mismatch
